  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\n**Given :** [{(38 × 23) - (4 ÷ 3)} + (6 - 3)] ÷ 2\n\n \n \n\n **Given signs**\n +\n -\n ×\n ÷\n \n \n\n **Means**\n ÷\n +\n -\n ×\n \n \n\nSo, after interchanging the signs :\n\n⇒[{(__**38 - 23**__) + (__**4 **____**×**____** 3**__)} ÷ (6 + 3)] × 2\n\n⇒[{__**15 **____**+ 12**__} ÷ (__**6 + 3**__)] × 2\n\n⇒[__**27 **____**÷ 9**__] × 2\n\n⇒__**3 **____**× 2**__\n\n⇒**6**\n\nHence, **\"6\"** is the correct answer.",
